    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'NotesGeneralDisclosureExplanatoryTextBlock' (NotesGeneralDisclosureExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Under question no. \n\n17: Financial disclosures in the Report are made on a consolidated basis. Non-financial disclosures cover Cipla    Limited and its subsidiaries unless otherwise specified in relevant sections. \n\n20: Limited Assurance has been obtained for 1(a) and 1(b) of essential indicators of Principle 3 and Reasonable Assurance has been obtained for 1(c) of essential indicators of Principle 3. Since the field does not provide for bifurcation of type of assurance, \"Reasonable\" has been selected of entire essential indicator 1 of Principle 3.\n\n21: Data provided is specific to Cipla Limited. \n\n24(A): National markets served includes 28 states and 8 union territories; Number of international markets served (i.e., 68) represents countries / markets where sales is more than USD 0.5  million.\n\n24(B): Contribution of exports as a percetage of total turnover is provided on a standalone basis\n\n25(B): Data for differently abled employees and workers under the non-permanent category is not available with the Company.\n\n29: Data provided on a standalone basis as on 31st March, 2025 in accordance with Companies Act, 2013.'.",
