  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'We recognise the importance of prioritising resource conservation in our own operations and across the value chain. As a resource intensive industry, we make focused efforts to reduce our water consumption and waste generation, increase water recycling and reuse, ensure safe waste disposal and conserve available natural resources.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues4)"
  },
