  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'We recognise the importance of prioritising resource conservation in our own operations and across the value chain. As a resource intensive industry, we make focused efforts to reduce our water consumption and waste generation, increase water recycling and reuse, ensure safe waste disposal and conserve available natural resources.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'Our commitment to limit adverse impact of operations on environment and communities we operate in, are reflected in our short-term ESG goals which are targeted to be achieved by 2030, as given below: \n\n1) Renewable electricity share: 80% for India manufacturing operations i.e. manufacturing units of Cipla Limited and all its wholly owned subsidiaries in India \n2) Greenhouse Gas (\"GHG\") Emission (Scope 1 & 2): (a) 30% absolute reduction (Scope-1 energy based and Scope -2) from baseline of FY 2023-24 for Global Cipla. (b) Build capacity infrastructure for green propellants used in Metered Dose Inhalers (\"MDI\"). \n3) Water Neutrality: Water Neutral for India manufacturing. \n4) Zero Waste to Landfill (\"ZWTL\"): Maintain ZWTL status for Cipla India and expand coverage for ZWTL to overseas sites for USA and One Africa. \n5) Antimicrobial Resistance(\"AMR\"): One Antibiotic Product per Cipla India site certified as per AMR manufacturing standard. \n6) Responsible Procurement: Minimum 80% of our critical Indian suppliers to comply with Cipla ESG framework. \n\nA few of our efforts to achieve these goals and subsequently reduce or mitigate ESG risks include: \na) Increased use of Renewable Energy (\"RE\") and investment in RE projects. \nb) Rainwater harvesting and water recycling.  \nc) Improved processing of waste to avoid incineration/ landfill disposal. \nd) Strong and responsible governance of our ESG related targets and performance. \n\nFor additional details refer Enterprise Risk Management on page no. 48 of the Integrated Annual Report for FY 2025-26.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues5)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Climate Action (Energy and Emissions)'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'As a pharmaceutical company, we are cognizant of the potential adverse impact of our operations on global warming and climate change. We strive to maintain responsible and ecofriendly operations. Our efforts are driven by our strategic targets that support a reduced carbon footprint. We have been investing in energy efficient technology, renewable energy, and alternative sources of energy.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues6)"
  },
  {
