  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Sustainable Supply Chain'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'We rely on a global supply chain and are committed to ensuring its sustainability. We recognise the importance of addressing issues such as working conditions, wages and the impact of climate change on our supply chain, and addressing any risks that we may be exposed to because of supply chain disruptions. Responsible and effective supply chain management is central to our ability to deliver on our commitment to patients.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'NA'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues7)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Sustainable Supply Chain'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'We rely on a global supply chain and are committed to ensuring its sustainability. We recognise the importance of addressing issues such as working conditions, wages and the impact of climate change on our supply chain, and addressing any risks that we may be exposed to because of supply chain disruptions. Responsible and effective supply chain management is central to our ability to deliver on our commitment to patients.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is '1) Implementation of Continuous Improvement Programme that focuses on creating alternative cost effective options for procurement of raw materials and mitigating risks of supply disruption. \n2) Continuous monitoring to identify potential disruptions and proactive deployment of mitigation measures (alternate sourcing, advance purchases, etc.). \n3) Maintaining sufficient inventory balances for key strategic molecules. \n4) Implementing, improving and digitising business planning procedures to enable scenario-based simulations and achieve greater end-to-end supply chain visibility.\n5) Logistics optimisation and cost rationalisation through rate contracts with sea liners and prior scheduling of dispatches. \n6) Leveraging Artificial Intelligence (\"AI\"), Machine Learning (\"ML\") technology and generative AI to improve efficiency and visibility of operations.\n\nFor additional details refer Enterprise Risk Management on page no. 48 of the Integrated Annual Report for FY 2025-26.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues8)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Innovation and Research and Development'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'The generic pharmaceutical industry is facing intense competition and dynamic pricing. It has become highly commoditised and is facing major market erosion. Regulators have significantly tightened guidelines surrounding bio-equivalence and impurities. R&D capabilities are required to build robust and compliant product dossiers that can withstand regulatory scrutiny. The market is also shifting to chronic and lifestyle disease, requiring companies to innovate their pipeline to match changing global healthcare requirements.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'NA'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues9)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Innovation and Research and Development'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'The generic pharmaceutical industry is facing intense competition and dynamic pricing. It has become highly commoditised and is facing major market erosion. Regulators have significantly tightened guidelines surrounding bio-equivalence and impurities. R&D capabilities are required to build robust and compliant product dossiers that can withstand regulatory scrutiny. The market is also shifting to chronic and lifestyle disease, requiring companies to innovate their pipeline to match changing global healthcare requirements.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is '1) Resource prioritisation and de-bottlenecking for key product launches. \n2) Where feasible, moving production to other facilities to reduce the risk of product launches failing due to quality challenges at manufacturing sites. \n3) Use innovative development techniques to mitigate risks of clinical failure and scale-up challenges. \n4) Robust project management to identify schedule slippages and prioritise timely de-risking interventions. \n5) A well-defined process to integrate lessons learned from past development experiences / failures to mitigate the risk of recurrence. \n6) Multiple learning and development initiatives to develop in-house R&D team’s competencies. \n7) Undertaking collaborations with regulatory bodies, companies and institutions to remain aligned with global best practices and improve disease diagnosis, manufacturing efficiency and strengthen efficacy of drug device combination products.\n\nFor additional details refer Enterprise Risk Management on page no. 48 of the Integrated Annual Report for FY 2025-26.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues10)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Corporate Governance and Business Ethics'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues11)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues11)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Corporate governance and business ethics guide compliance with regulations and ethical standards, vital in an industry where patient safety and drug efficacy are paramount. Ethical practices help mitigate risks of litigation and scandals, protecting the Company’s reputation and financial stability.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues11)"
  },
  {
