  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Corporate Governance and Business Ethics'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Corporate governance and business ethics guide compliance with regulations and ethical standards, vital in an industry where patient safety and drug efficacy are paramount. Ethical practices help mitigate risks of litigation and scandals, protecting the Company’s reputation and financial stability.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is '1) Creating effective policies and procedures to ensure compliance and prevent unlawful/ fraudulent activities. \n2) Comprehensive global compliance management framework to track compliance with existing laws and regulations and to stay abreast of emerging regulations. \n3) Continuous monitoring of compliances to avoid surprises and ensure timely remedial action.\n4) Comprehensively defined layers of preventive and detective controls to ensure compliance with laid down processes and applicable regulations.\n5) Harnessing risk analytics to automate and identify areas of non-compliance, fraud and business waste.\n6) Promoting ethical behaviour by providing training and awareness sessions on our code of conduct.\n\nFor additional details refer Enterprise Risk Management on page no. 48 of the Integrated Annual Report for FY 2025-26.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues12)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Product Quality and Safety'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues13)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues13)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'As a healthcare company, our primary commitment is to our patients. We endeavour to provide them with high quality medicines that positively impact their health and wellbeing.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues13)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'NA'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues13)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Positive Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues13)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Product Quality and Safety'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues14)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues14)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'As a healthcare company, our primary commitment is to our patients. We endeavour to provide them with high quality medicines that positively impact their health and wellbeing.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues14)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is '1) Robust Quality Management Systems (\"QMS\"), adequately assisted by digitisation to adhere to applicable and emerging regulatory requirements applicable to products manufactured at Cipla locations as well as sourced from third parties. \n2) Comprehensive quality improvement and training programme with focus on historically known gaps and challenges. \n3) Implementation of automation tools in process and equipment review, predictive data analytics and smart interlocks to monitor critical activities and eliminate manual activities, reviews and errors. \n4) Minimising microbiological excursions by enhancing sterile work practices. \n5) Investigate identified non-conformities and define appropriate Corrective and Preventive Action (\"CAPA\"). \n6) Proactive identification of potential challenges through periodic reviews and audits conducted internally. \n7) Rigorous vendor and contract manufacturer audits on factors such as current Good Manufacturing Practice (\"cGMP\") and QMS compliance.\n\nFor additional details refer Enterprise Risk Management on page no. 48 of the Integrated Annual Report for FY 2025-26.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues14)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues14)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Occupational Health and Safety'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues15)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'R'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues15)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Ensuring a safe and healthy workplace is crucial to protect employees from potential hazards such as exposure to toxic compounds, ergonomic risks, and accidental injuries. Moreover, a robust health and safety program helps in maintaining regulatory compliance, avoiding legal liabilities, and minimizing operational disruptions caused by safety incidents.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues15)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate' (InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate) is 'We continuously undertake and monitor initiatives aimed at inclusion, safety and wellbeing of our employees, consumers and the society within which we operate.\nOur commitment to limit adverse impact of operations on environment and communities we operate in, are reflected in our short-term ESG goals which are targeted to be achieved by 2030, as given below:\nOccupational Health & Safety: Zero Fatality in manufacturing operations.\n\nFor additional details refer Enterprise Risk Management on page no. 48 of the Integrated Annual Report for FY 2025-26.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: InCaseOfRiskApproachToAdaptOrMitigate, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues15)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity' (FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity) is 'Negative Implications'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: FinancialImplicationsOfTheRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues15)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MaterialIssueIdentified' (MaterialIssueIdentified) is 'Human Resource Development'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MaterialIssueIdentified, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues16)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity' (IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity) is 'O'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: IndicateWhetherRiskOrOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues16)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity' (RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity) is 'Our approach to human capital reflects our commitment to fostering a supportive and empowering environment for all stakeholders. We rely on skilled and dedicated individuals who drive positive outcomes for patients and the broader community. To support them, we focus on creating a workplace that enables growth, engagement and wellbeing.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: RationaleForIdentifyingTheRiskOpportunity, Context: D_EntitysMaterialResponsibleBusinessConductIssues16)"
  },
