    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PerformanceOfTheEntityAgainstTheSpecificCommitmentsGoalsAndTargetsAlongWithReasonsInCaseTheSameAreNotMetExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: D_Principle3)"
