  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityHaveAnAntiCorruptionOrAntiBriberyPolicy' (DoesTheEntityHaveAnAntiCorruptionOrAntiBriberyPolicy) is 'Yes'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoesTheEntityHaveAnAntiCorruptionOrAntiBriberyPolicy, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'AntiCorruptionOrAntiBriberyPolicyExplanatoryTextBlock' (AntiCorruptionOrAntiBriberyPolicyExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'The Company has a formal Anti-Bribery and Anti-Corruption (\"ABAC\") Policy in place.\n\nBrief Summary of the Policy:\n\nThe Policy establishes zero tolerance towards bribery, corruption, facilitation payments and kickbacks. It applies to all employees (associates), directors and business partners (as defined in the Policy) across all Cipla entities globally.\n\nThis Policy demonstrates our firm position against corruption and bribery.\n\nKey provisions include:\n\n1. Absolute prohibition on offering, soliciting, giving or receiving bribes (directly or indirectly).\n2. Strict controls and guidelines w.r.t. gifts, hospitality, entertainment and donations, etc.\n3. Instructions for interactions with Government Officials and Healthcare Professionals.\n4. Robust requirements for accurate books, records and internal controls.\n5. Mandatory reporting of concerns through the Whistle Blower mechanism, with protection against retaliation.\n\nOversight and enforcement are governed by the Chief Compliance Officer, Ethics Committee and the Board\nof Directors. Violations may result in disciplinary action, termination, fines, or prosecution.\n\nAdditionally, the policy assists business partners and associates in reporting bribery and corruption in alignment with our Whistle Blower Policy. As part of our Enterprise Risk Management activities, we conduct risk assessments regarding compliance with anti-corruption and anti-bribery laws, as required, and implement appropriate mitigation measures. All employees also receive training on anti-corruption and anti-bribery practices as a part of our Code of Conduct training.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: AntiCorruptionOrAntiBriberyPolicyExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[As of 2026-03-31] Fact: The value for 'WebLinkAtAntiCorruptionOrAntiBriberyPolicyIsPlace' (WebLinkAtAntiCorruptionOrAntiBriberyPolicyIsPlace) is 'https://www.cipla.com/sites/default/files/2026-01/Anti-Bribery-and-Anti-Corruption-Policy.pdf'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: WebLinkAtAntiCorruptionOrAntiBriberyPolicyIsPlace, Context: ICYMain)"
  },
