  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoard' (DoesTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoard) is 'Yes'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoesTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoard, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoardExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoardExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Yes, the Company has in place a 'Conflict of Interest Policy' and a ‘Policy on Related Party Transactions’, which are applicable to our Board members. Transactions with the Board members or any entity in which such Board members are concerned or interested are required to be approved by the Audit Committee and the Board of Directors. In such cases, the interested directors abstain themselves from the discussions at the meeting. \n\nWeblink:\n\nConflict of Interest Policy: https://www.cipla.com/sites/default/files/2019-06/1554391523_1530187477_Conflict%20of%20Interest%20Policy%20-%20V1%20fc.pdf\n\nPolicy on Related Party Transactions: https://www.cipla.com/sites/default/files/2026-02/Policy-on-Related-party-transactions.pdf'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfTheEntityHaveProcessesInPlaceToAvoidOrManageConflictOfInterestsInvolvingMembersOfTheBoardExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'NotesPrinciple1ExplanatoryTextBlock' (NotesPrinciple1ExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Under essesntial indicator 1 - Board of Directors training and awarness programmes include programmes which are offered to all the Board members of Cipla Limited. For further details, please refer Familiarisation Programme for Independent Directors in the 'Corporate Governance Report'.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: NotesPrinciple1ExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'TotalNumberOfAwarenessProgrammesHeld' (TotalNumberOfAwarenessProgrammesHeld) is '2' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: TotalNumberOfAwarenessProgrammesHeld, Context: D_AwarenessProgrammesConductedForValueChainPartners1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'TopicsOrPrinciplesCoveredUnderTheTraining' (TopicsOrPrinciplesCoveredUnderTheTraining) is 'During the year, we conducted capacity building sessions which focused on \nenhancing sustainability awareness across the value chain. These programs covered topics such as Net Zero, Water and Waste Management, Health and Safety, Human Rights, Diversity and Inclusion, Labour Management, Community Relations and CSR, Corporate Governance etc. We further utilised our membership in Pharmaceutical Supply Chain Initiative (\"PSCI\") to provide in-person workshops for our suppliers. Further details are available on page no. 101 of the Relationship Capital section.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: TopicsOrPrinciplesCoveredUnderTheTraining, Context: D_AwarenessProgrammesConductedForValueChainPartners1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfValueChainPartnersCoveredUnderTheAwarenessProgrammes' (PercentageOfValueChainPartnersCoveredUnderTheAwarenessProgrammes) is '0.0675' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfValueChainPartnersCoveredUnderTheAwarenessProgrammes, Context: D_AwarenessProgrammesConductedForValueChainPartners1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfRAndD' (PercentageOfRAndD) is '1' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfRAndD, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfRAndD' (PercentageOfRAndD) is '1' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfRAndD, Context: DPYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToRAndD' (DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToRAndD) is 'Our R&D efforts are focused on enhancing the accessibility and affordability of medicines globally. In addition, our R&D investments have led to process enhancements that strengthen product safety, promote sustainable production and minimise waste. Further details are available on page no. 65 of the Intellectual Capital.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToRAndD, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfCapex' (PercentageOfCapex) is '0.17' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfCapex, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfCapex' (PercentageOfCapex) is '0.25' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfCapex, Context: DPYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToCapex' (DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToCapex) is 'Capex investments in specific technologies and corresponding environmental and social impacts are detailed on page no. 59 of the Manufactured Capital. These initiatives have inter-alia resulted in reduced emissions, improved air quality, energy savings and better water conservation.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfImprovementsInEnvironmentalAndSocialImpactsDueToCapex, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DoesTheEntityHaveProceduresInPlaceForSustainableSourcing' (DoesTheEntityHaveProceduresInPlaceForSustainableSourcing) is 'true'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DoesTheEntityHaveProceduresInPlaceForSustainableSourcing, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PercentageOfInputsWereSourcedSustainably' (PercentageOfInputsWereSourcedSustainably) is '0.2161' xbrli:pure.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PercentageOfInputsWereSourcedSustainably, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DescribeTheProcessesInPlaceToSafelyReclaimYourProductsForReusingRecyclingAndDisposingAtTheEndOfLifeForPlasticsIncludingPackagingExplanatoryTextBlock' (DescribeTheProcessesInPlaceToSafelyReclaimYourProductsForReusingRecyclingAndDisposingAtTheEndOfLifeForPlasticsIncludingPackagingExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'As a pharmaceutical company, we are not involved in the reclamation or recycling of products once they reach the end of their lifecycle. However, we have put in place robust waste management procedures across all our manufacturing sites and warehouses. Unsold expired products are gathered by our warehouses and disposed off safely through incineration.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DescribeTheProcessesInPlaceToSafelyReclaimYourProductsForReusingRecyclingAndDisposingAtTheEndOfLifeForPlasticsIncludingPackagingExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DescribeTheProcessesInPlaceToSafelyReclaimYourProductsForReusingRecyclingAndDisposingAtTheEndOfLifeForEWasteExplanatoryTextBlock' (DescribeTheProcessesInPlaceToSafelyReclaimYourProductsForReusingRecyclingAndDisposingAtTheEndOfLifeForEWasteExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'As a pharmaceutical company, we are not involved in the reclamation or recycling of products once they reach the end of their lifecycle. However, we have put in place robust waste management procedures across all our manufacturing sites and warehouses. Unsold expired products are gathered by our warehouses and disposed off safely through incineration.'.",
