    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'NotesPrinciple2ExplanatoryTextBlock' (NotesPrinciple2ExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Under leadership indicator 4: Being a pharmaceutical company, Cipla does not reclaim products at the end of their lifecycle for reuse or recycling, given the  inherent nature of the industry. Instead, products that have expired or remain unused are collected from the market and securely disposed of through incineration.'.",
