    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSignificantRisksOrConcernsArisingFromTheAssessmentsOfPlantAndOfficeExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfAnyCorrectiveActionsTakenOrUnderwayToAddressSignificantRisksOrConcernsArisingFromTheAssessmentsOfPlantAndOfficeExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'There were no significant risks/concerns arising from the assessments at question 10 above'.",
