  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfTheScopeAndCoverageOfAnyHumanRightsDueDiligenceConductedExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfTheScopeAndCoverageOfAnyHumanRightsDueDiligenceConductedExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Independent human rights assessments are conducted across operations on a three-year cycle. In FY 2025-26,\nhuman rights audits and assessments were completed for major Indian manufacturing locations (including\nsites of our joint ventures), international facilities and depots. These assessments were conducted in alignment with SA 8,000 standards and covered the entire workforce, with particular attention to potential risks involving minors, women, and vulnerable groups'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DetailsOfTheScopeAndCoverageOfAnyHumanRightsDueDiligenceConductedExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
