    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'NotesPrinciple5ExplanatoryTextBlock' (NotesPrinciple5ExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Under essential indicator 1 - This data includes employees/workers who were active and separated during the year and  please note that the total column has been automatically updated using information from employees and workforce data provided in question no. 25 of Section A of the General Disclosure. For accurate details, please refer to the Annual Report, where the disclosure with the correct total column is provided. \n\nUnder essential indicator 2 - This data is specific to Cipla Limited and Indian subsidiaries and payment of minimum wages to non-permanent employees and workers is the responsibility of the respective contractor. Please note that the total column has been automatically updated using information from employees and workforce data provided in question no. 25 of Section A of the General Disclosure. \n\nUnder essential indicator 7 - This data includes complaints only specific to Cipla Limited and its Indian Subsidiaries as per statutory requirements.'.",
