  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DetailsOfSignificantDirectAndIndirectImpactOfTheEntityOnBiodiversityInSuchAreasAlongWithPreventionAndRemediationActivitiesExplanatoryTextBlock' (DetailsOfSignificantDirectAndIndirectImpactOfTheEntityOnBiodiversityInSuchAreasAlongWithPreventionAndRemediationActivitiesExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Bommasandra site is under notified Industrial Area, located within 10 km of the Bannerghatta National Park. We have conducted Environmental Impact Assessment studies and no significant impact of the organisation on Biodiversity has been observed.'.",
