  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PublicPolicyAdvocated' (PublicPolicyAdvocated) is 'Clarity on the prior-intimation pathway for bioavailability / bioequivalence (\"BA/BE\") studies.\n\nAdvocated: Regulatory clarity on the implementation of the prior-intimation pathway for BA / BE studies pursuant to amendments to the New Drugs and Clinical Trials (NDCT) Rules, 2019.\n\nOutcome: Improved clarity on the operationalisation of the prior-intimation pathway for eligible BA /BE studies, enabling greater predictability in study initiation timelines, while reinforcing the understanding that complex products remain subject to full BA / BE study requirements within the streamlined regulatory framework.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PublicPolicyAdvocated, Context: D_PublicPolicyAxis1)"
  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'MethodResortedForSuchAdvocacy' (MethodResortedForSuchAdvocacy) is 'Representations through industry associations viz FICCI, CII and IPA.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: MethodResortedForSuchAdvocacy, Context: D_PublicPolicyAxis1)"
  },
