  },
  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PublicPolicyAdvocated' (PublicPolicyAdvocated) is 'Sustaining availability of critical inputs (HFC-152a propellant) amid HFC phase-down.\n\nAdvocated: A calibrated and streamlined regulatory approach to HFC‑152a imports, instead of blanket prohibitions, to ensure continuity of supply for essential therapies while aligning with environmental compliance requirements.\n\nOutcome: Import of HFC-152a has been moved to a restricted import framework route through official digital mechanisms, enhancing process visibility, reduced approval uncertainties and improved supply continuity.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PublicPolicyAdvocated, Context: D_PublicPolicyAxis2)"
  },
