    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'PublicPolicyAdvocated' (PublicPolicyAdvocated) is 'Streamlining permissions via deemed approval for Form-29 licenses\n\nAdvocated: Introduction of a time‑bound approval mechanism, including deemed approvals, to streamline Form‑29 licences (a permission issued by State Licensing Authorities to manufacture small quantities of drugs for examination, testing or analysis) and reduce delays from dual (CDSCO and State) approvals.\n\nOutcome: Implementation of time‑bound processing and deemed approval provisions improved timelines, reduced approval delays and enhanced predictability for R&D and testing activities.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: PublicPolicyAdvocated, Context: D_PublicPolicyAxis3)"
  },
