  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'NotesPrinciple8ExplanatoryTextBlock' (NotesPrinciple8ExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Under Essential Indicator 1 - During the year, the Company was not required to undertake any SIA under the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013.\n\nUnder Essential Indicator 5 - This data pertains to permanent employees and workers of Cipla Limited.\n\nUndere Leadership Indicator 3 - The Company maintains a neutral approach in its supplier selection and procurement processes, guided by its Responsible Sourcing Policy (https://www.cipla.com/sites/default/files/2024-08/Responsible-Sourcing-Policy.pdf), Supplier Code of Conduct (https://www.cipla.com/sites/default/files/2024-08/Supplier-Code-of-Conduct_0.pdf) and Supply Chain Management Sustainability Policy (https://www.cipla.com/sites/default/files/SSCM%20Policy-Final_1.pdf). The Company currently does not factor in criteria related to marginalised or vulnerable groups in its supplier selection.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: NotesPrinciple8ExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
