  {
    "text": "[Unknown Period] Fact: The value for 'DescribeTheMechanismsInPlaceToReceiveAndRespondToConsumerComplaintsAndFeedbackExplanatoryTextBlock' (DescribeTheMechanismsInPlaceToReceiveAndRespondToConsumerComplaintsAndFeedbackExplanatoryTextBlock) is 'Consumer complaints and feedback are addressed through a robust mechanism and focused efforts are made to do so in an effective and timely manner. All patients/consumers, healthcare professionals and other concerned stakeholders can report any adverse event or product complaint through a dedicated phone line and mailbox. Consumer complaints received at drugsafety@cipla.com are assessed and addressed as per Standard Operating Procedures (\"SOP\"). Depending on the nature, the complaint is forwarded to the relevant department for possible further action, including appropriate response to the complaints. Consumers can also submit their complaints/ feedback as per the mechanism set out in our Code of Conduct available on the Company’s website at https://www.cipla.com/sites/default/files/1530274684_Cipla---Code-of-Conduct-FC.PDF.pdf. We also take appropriate steps to address consumer complaints raised in consumer forums in accordance with applicable laws and regulations. Guidance on adverse event reporting is also hosted on the website of the Company at https://www.cipla.com/sites/default/files/Guidance-on-adverse-event-reporting.pdf.'.",
    "source": "XBRL Fact (Concept: DescribeTheMechanismsInPlaceToReceiveAndRespondToConsumerComplaintsAndFeedbackExplanatoryTextBlock, Context: DCYMain)"
  },
